rnment of Myanmar is  using this product to make the genocide  of Roe hanga acceptable in Myanmar there  are these horrible things going on and  I'm sitting there going guys you need to  you need to fix the product you need to  change the way the algorithms work you  need to change the business model but  there's a good outcome here we can make  this better than it is today you want to  talk to them they talk to us a facebook  spokesman told us in response to your  article quote we've made major progress  in combating false news fighting  harassment bringing more transparency in  transparency to advertising and stopping  bad actors from meddling in foreign  elections we know we have more to do and  we will put our heads down and do the  work you've been talking about outside  actors what about inside Facebook what  they use to make money to capture people  how much of that is part of what you're  describing it is it's  actly the problem that essentially the  very tools it's the Russians didn't do  they didn't hack the system they didn't  do something special they did exactly  what advertisers are supposed to do and  the really important thing to understand  is advertising is a small part of the  problem it's Facebook groups it's this  notion that in facebook what they really  want do is appeal to fear and anger  because those are the things that  motivate you they engage you that get  you really focused on the kind of I'm  sure how to solve the problem as you see  it so I think the most important thing  we have to focus on today is children  and my dear friend Jim Steyer at Common  Sense Media he gives me the rules of  thumb for parents right the most  important thing is you have to be a good  role model if you're using your phone 24  hours a day if you're using it you know  your there's your children are gonna  pick up on that you have to be their  best teacher you have to set clear  limits right as what is the appropriate  usage of these products and then they  have a thing called device free dinner  where they're trying to say to people  listen have this meal where the whole  family's together and you actually talk  to each other and I'd say if you're an  adult all those rules apply as well they  set limits honestly don't let turn off  your notifications right don't let this  thing control your life really  interesting I could talk to you for a  long time well I don't come back this  issue is not going to be solved quickly  and we're gonna have to work together  and thank you so much for giving us a  chance because I really think we think  you should go try to talk to Cheryl and  mark I would like you stop talking but  keep reaching out to them all right  thank you thank you for her thank you  very much Roger it McNamee we're glad  you came today
 

